    "Content": "<p><b>What&nbsp;and&nbsp;Why:</b></p><p>Rolling&nbsp;out&nbsp;to&nbsp;Frontier,&nbsp;rewrite&nbsp;slide&nbsp;titles&nbsp;as&nbsp;takeaways&nbsp;that&nbsp;state&nbsp;the&nbsp;conclusion,&nbsp;so&nbsp;anyone&nbsp;skimming&nbsp;your&nbsp;headlines&nbsp;gets&nbsp;the&nbsp;argument;&nbsp;helping&nbsp;your&nbsp;slide&nbsp;land&nbsp;with&nbsp;more&nbsp;impact.</p><p><b>Rollout&nbsp;Schedule:</b></p><p>Frontier:&nbsp;Rolling&nbsp;out&nbsp;in&nbsp;early&nbsp;September&nbsp;2026.</p><p><b>Impact&nbsp;on&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Organization:</b></p><p>Who&nbsp;is&nbsp;affected:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Users&nbsp;of&nbsp;PowerPoint&nbsp;for&nbsp;Mac.</li></ul><p>Platform:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>PowerPoint&nbsp;for&nbsp;Mac.</li></ul><p>No&nbsp;admin&nbsp;configuration&nbsp;changes&nbsp;are&nbsp;required.</p><p><b>Action&nbsp;Required/Recommendations:</b></p><p>No&nbsp;action&nbsp;is&nbsp;required.</p><p>A&nbsp;Copilot&nbsp;license&nbsp;is&nbsp;required.</p><p>You&nbsp;may&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;inform&nbsp;your&nbsp;help&nbsp;desk&nbsp;and&nbsp;users&nbsp;about&nbsp;the&nbsp;updated&nbsp;experience.&nbsp;Review&nbsp;and&nbsp;update&nbsp;internal&nbsp;training&nbsp;or&nbsp;support&nbsp;materials.</p>",
